      en: ["Amílcar Cabral co-founded the PAIGC party in 1956.", "The statue is located in a prominent square near the city's main airport.", "January 20th is celebrated as Heroes' Day in honor of Cabral.", "Cabral was assassinated in 1973, just before independence was achieved.", "The monument is a key site for official state ceremonies and visits.", "He is revered as the ideological father of the Cape Verdean nation."],
      es: ["Inauguración: 20 de enero de 2003", "Material: bronce y granito", "Ubicación: Praça Amílcar Cabral, Praia", "Altura: 2,5 metros", "Homenajeado: Amílcar Cabral, revolucionario", "Inscripción: con cita de Cabral"],
      pt: ["Inauguração: 20 de janeiro de 2003", "Material: bronze e granito", "Localização: Praça Amílcar Cabral, Praia", "Altura: 2,5 metros", "Homenageado: Amílcar Cabral, revolucionário", "Inscrição: com citação de Cabral"],
      fr: ["Inauguration : 20 janvier 2003", "Matériau : bronze et granit", "Emplacement : Praça Amílcar Cabral, Praia", "Hauteur : 2,5 mètres", "Personnalité : Amílcar Cabral, révolutionnaire", "Inscription : avec une citation de Cabral"],
