      en: ["The construction of the church was completed in 1862.", "It serves as the Pro-Cathedral for the city of Mindelo.", "The building features a classic yellow and white facade.", "It is the oldest significant religious structure in Mindelo.", "The church is the center for the annual Our Lady of Light festival.", "It is located in the historic 'Pracinha der Igreja' area."],
