      en: ["The stadium has a seating capacity of roughly 5,000.", "It is the home turf for the historic club CS Mindelense.", "The field features a high-quality artificial grass surface.", "It is named in honor of the local athlete Adérito Sena.", "The venue is a frequent host for Cape Verdean Cup finals.", "It is located near the Ribeira Bote neighborhood in Mindelo."],
      es: ["Construcción: 1955", "Capacidad: 5.000 plazas", "Ubicación: Chã d'Areia, Mindelo", "Renovación: 2002", "Homenajeado: Adérito Sena, futbolista caboverdiano", "Uso principal: fútbol"],
      pt: ["Construído: 1955", "Capacidade: 5.000 lugares", "Localização: Chã d'Areia, Mindelo", "Renovação: 2002", "Nomeado por: Adérito Sena, futebolista cabo-verdiano", "Uso principal: futebol"],
      fr: ["Construction : 1955", "Capacité : 5 000 places", "Emplacement : Chã d'Areia, Mindelo", "Rénovation : 2002", "Éponyme : Adérito Sena, footballeur capverdien", "Usage principal : football"],
